OL,3,GNEWSALand returned to charity after
OL,4,Amore than 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharity bosses said they needed to take
OL,7,Fa "deep breath" before deciding what to
OL,8,Fdo with land which has been returned to
OL,9,Fthem after more than 30 years.
OL,11,FThe National Trust of Guernsey said it
OL,12,Fhad secured land at Creve Coeur on the
OL,13,Fisland's north coast.
OL,15,FA five-year lease started in September
OL,16,F1995 to allow the States of Guernsey to
OL,17,Fuse fields owned by the trust as an
OL,18,Femergency landfill, but despite this
OL,19,Fnot being extended, talks to return the
OL,20,Farea to the charity came up against
OL,21,Fseveral issues.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
