OL,3,GNEWSALand returned to charity after
OL,4,Amore than 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrust president Mike Brown said he was
OL,7,F"extremely pleased" to have the land
OL,8,Fback but no decisions had been made
OL,9,Fabout what it would be used for.
